&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Stream Processing</title><link>https://www.curiosities.dev/computer-science/algorithms-and-data-structures/derived-data/stream-processing/</link><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.curiosities.dev/computer-science/algorithms-and-data-structures/derived-data/stream-processing/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;stream processing system (near-real-time system)&lt;/strong&gt; consumes inputs and
produces outputs, rather than responding to a request. A stream job operates on
events shortly after they happen, allowing the system lower latency than the
equivalent batch processing systems. &lt;span class="citation-ref"&gt;&lt;a href="#Kleppmann2017-Ch10"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

 

